# This file is read by the Secrets Gradle plugin for BuildConfig values.
#
# GEMINI_API_KEY is deliberately NOT here. The key lives in the backend's own
# .env and is never packaged into the APK: an APK is decompilable, so a bundled
# key is a public key. The app reaches Gemini through authenticated /ai/*
# endpoints instead.
#
# To enable AI, set GEMINI_API_KEY in backend/.env — not here.
